  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">企鵝世界</span></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">1.18.2+ 版本需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">GeckoLib&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/610/296/64/64/637992132031410062.png\" alt=\"GeckoLibImage\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\"></span></a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">此模組可能與 Optifine 不相容！</span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">《企鵝世界》是一款模組，為遊戲新增了 11 種全新的企鵝，牠們會自然生成於世界中。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">每種企鵝都會在與其真實棲息地相似的生態域中生成。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">以下是所有企鵝的清單！</span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/514/25/allthepenguins.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
